# CLIo logo - Glitch
# White letters split into red and cyan ghosts (chromatic aberration),
# one slipped scanline and a few stray noise blocks. Suits the 'techno'
# style. 41x5, small 20x2.
@palette
a=#ff2a6d
b=#ff2a6d on_#f2f2f2
c=#f2f2f2
d=#05d9e8
e=#f2f2f2 on_#05d9e8
f=#f2f2f2 on_#ff2a6d
g=#05d9e8 on_#f2f2f2
h=#ff2a6d on_#05d9e8
@effect glitch
@art
  ▄▀███████ ████     ████████
 ███▀▀      ████    ▒  ████
 ▀▀▀▀▄▄     ▀▀▀▀▄▄     ▀▀▀▀▄▄   ▀▀███▀▄▄▄
 ███▀▄      ████       ████   ████  ████
  ▀▀███████ ████████ ████████  ▀▀████▀▀
@mask
  abccccccd accd     accccccd
 acced      accd    a  accd
 acfgcd     acfgcd     acfgcd   afcccgccd
 accgd      accd       accd   accd  accd
  afccccccd accccccd accccccd  afcccced
@small
▄▀▀▀▀███  ▀▀█▀▀▄▄▄▄
▀▀▀▄▄██▀▄▄▄▀█▀▀▀▀▀▀▀
@mask
abecdacd  afcedaccd
afgcdacgcdabcghfgbed
@ascii
  _######## ####     ########
 ####"      ####    %  ####
 ""##__     ""##__     ""##__   "#####___
 ####_      ####       ####   ####  ####
  "######## ######## ########  "######"
@mask
  aaccccccd accd     accccccd
 acccd      accd    a  accd
 accdcd     accdcd     accdcd   accccdccd
 accdd      accd       accd   accd  accd
  acccccccd accccccd accccccd  accccccd
